For recurring ARC-stream tasks, classify demos by transformation family and compare each to the test's structural signature before extrapolating. A large number of examples is not coverage if their geometry and output relationship differ. In particular, compact outputs of varying dimensions do not establish a reduction, sampling, or encoding for a test with a repeated patterned grid.

